---
/* Hero illustration: a night-time shopfront showing the kinds of signs we make. */
---
<div class="relative mx-auto aspect-[4/5] w-full max-w-[320px] overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1b1b2c] to-[#0d0d1a] shadow-2xl shadow-black/20 sm:max-w-sm" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of a shopfront with a neon OPEN sign, 3D café letters and a golden name plate">
  <div class="absolute inset-x-6 top-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-black/60 px-6 py-7 text-center">
    <div class="neon font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">OPEN</div>
    <div class="neon-cyan mt-2 font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.4em]">late night</div>
  </div>
  <div class="absolute inset-x-6 top-[46%] text-center font-display text-5xl font-bold tracking-widest text-[#ffb800] sm:text-6xl"
    style="text-shadow: 0 1px 0 #b37f00, 0 2px 0 #a37400, 0 3px 0 #8f6600, 0 4px 0 #7a5700, 0 10px 24px rgb(255 184 0 / .45)">CAFÉ</div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-6 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-[#f5d77a] via-[#c9a13b] to-[#8a6a1c] px-4 py-3 shadow-lg">
    <div class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-[#14141f]">The Kapoors</div>
    <div class="text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[#14141f]/70">H-21 · DLF II</div>
  </div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-8 right-6 rounded-lg border border-white/30 bg-white/10 px-4 py-3">
    <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#00c2ff]">Acrylic</div>
    <div class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-white">Cabin 04</div>
  </div>
</div>
